commit 2871d4babe7af76dec50b7af49c73f9f1e7a812c

C03: summarizing this or the current page reads the page open in the browser session and quotes its lead (WEB1539)

«resumime esta página» and «resumime la página actual» reached no reader: summarizing was not a request head and the page read required «lee». Summarizing this or the current page (no document word) is now the reviewed `browser.page.read` of the page open in the product's CDP session; the composer receives the title, the site and the beginning of the visible text exactly as read (`_project_page_read`), is told to name the page and quote its first sentences inside quotation marks, and `_page_read_quote_defect` rejects quoted passages that are not in that text and numbers it does not carry. Nothing is summarized in the model's own words.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


